es of [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 2 onions, [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Cut the lamb into large 4 [[Cookbook:cm|cm]] chunks. \n#Combine the nutmeg, cinnamon, cardamom, garlic cloves, black pepper, cayenne pepper, lemon, and vinegar in a small mixing bowl and pour over meat.\n#[[Cookbook:Marinating|Marinate]] for 2 hours or more. \n#[[Cookbook:Grilling|Grill]] the onions with some [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] for few minutes. \n#Drain meat, pat dry, and grill until golden brown.\n#Serve with [[Cookbook:Pita|pita bread]], [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomato]], fresh onion, [[Cookbook:Tabbouleh|tabbouleh]], [[Cookbook:Tzatziki|tzatziki]], [[Cookbook:Lettuce|lettuce]] and [[Cookbook:Chili|chili]] sauce.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using lamb]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cardamom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Lamb Shawarma","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1.5 kg leg of lamb or other tender cut","sourceText":"1.5 kg leg of lamb or other tender cut","amountText":"1.5 kg leg of lamb or other tender cut","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tsp nutmeg","sourceText":"1 tsp nutmeg","amountText":"1 tsp nutmeg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp cinnamon","sourceText":"1 tsp cinnamon","amountText":"1 tsp cinnamon","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tsp cardamom","sourceText":"1 tsp cardamom","amountText":"1 tsp cardamom","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5